{"repo": {"description": {"en-US": "Private, self-hosted Android apps on Logos — no Google, no accounts, no central server. Peers: a peer-to-peer messenger over Logos, MeshCore (LoRa) and Bluetooth mesh, end-to-end and at-rest encrypted. Booth & Receiver: broadcast and tune in to decentralised anonymous radio over Tor + Logos Messaging."}, "timestamp": 1785363757000}, "packages": {"com.logoschat": {"metadata": {"added": 1785280344000, "categories": ["Internet"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/xAlisher/peers/issues", "lastUpdated": 1785363757000, "license": "MIT", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/xAlisher/peers", "webSite": "https://peers.tech", "authorName": "xAlisher", "name": {"en-US": "Peers"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Private peer-to-peer messenger over Logos, MeshCore & Bluetooth"}, "description": {"en-US": "A private, peer-to-peer messenger. Your identity lives on this device — no phone\nnumber, no account, no central server, no Google.\n\nReach people over three transports: Logos (a pure-Rust delivery node), MeshCore\n(LoRa radio), or Bluetooth mesh — one shared timeline, colour-coded by transport.\n1:1 and group chats are end-to-end encrypted with MLS; send voice notes, images,\ncamera photos, and location. Works offline over Bluetooth/LoRa when the network\nis down.\n\nYour messages, encryption keys, and identity are encrypted at rest (Android\nKeystore + SQLCipher). Optional PIN lock with an auto-lock and duress-wipe."}, "preferredSigner": "fac61745dc0903786fb9ede62a962b399f7348f0bb6f899b8332667591033b9c"}, "versions": {"e3e8269dee9cad9a53ddf62650fd03ebdeef29f5263bdc11e211ccba27571c74": {"added": 1785363757000, "file": {"name": "/peers-0.7.69-arm64.apk", "sha256": "e3e8269dee9cad9a53ddf62650fd03ebdeef29f5263bdc11e211ccba27571c74", "size": 69448671}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "0.7.69", "versionCode": 81, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["fac61745